{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## Metryki efektu rozwiazania (Etap 19c)\nZrodlo: telemetria spanow `wniosek.*` i `llm.*` w Log Analytics (bez Postgresa). Kazdy wniosek trafia do czlowieka, wiec metryka wyjatkow to odsetek rekomendacji `SKIEROWANIE`, nie 'odsetek do czlowieka'. Wybierz role ponizej, zeby odfiltrowac ruch testowy."
      },
      "name": "opis"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "7c1f3b0a-5e7d-4c11-9a52-0d3a6b1e2f01",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Rola",
            "label": "Rola (cloud_RoleName)",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "\"",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "AppDependencies | summarize by AppRoleName | where AppRoleName startswith 'uw-' | order by AppRoleName asc | project value = AppRoleName, label = AppRoleName",
            "value": ["uw-api", "uw-zasiew"],
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [],
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 2592000000
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "crossComponentResources": ["${workspace_id}"]
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "parametry"
    }%{ for i, zapytanie in zapytania },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": ${jsonencode(zapytanie)},
        "size": 4,
        "title": ${jsonencode(tytuly[i])},
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 2592000000
        },
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "crossComponentResources": ["${workspace_id}"],
        "visualization": "table"
      },
      "name": "metryka-${i + 1}"
    }%{ endfor }
  ],
  "$schema": "https://github.com/Microsoft/Application-Insights-Workbooks/blob/master/schema/workbook.json"
}
